{"t":"Damage Reflection","s":"damage-reflection-5f49c","k":"outro","i":"assets/wiki/Eldritch_Shield_7edef1.gif","q":1,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><aside class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-twbox2 pi-layout-default\" role=\"region\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Damage Reflection</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"implementation-date\">11.40.5409<br/>July 25, 2017<br/>Summer Update 2017</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"status\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Status</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Active</div>\n</div>\n</aside>\n<b>Damage Reflection</b> is a passive ability that some creatures have and that players can have through some equipment. It's similar to the Parry Charm. \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Damage_Reflection_by_Players\">Damage Reflection by Players</span></h2>\n<p>Characters can receive the ability to reflect damage through some equipment listed below. Damage reflection in this case has some special rules:\n</p>\n<ul><li>The reflected damage cannot be greater than 1% of the maximum hit points of the attacker.\n<ul><li>For example, if the combined damage reflection of all worn equipment is 80, it will still only reflect a maximum of 50 damage on creatures with 5000 health points.</li>\n<li>This 1% limit can be exceeded through the use of <a href=\"#/wiki/Prey%20System\">Damage Boost Prey</a> on a selected creature, so the maximum amount of damage reflection can be higher.</li></ul></li>\n<li>Damage reflection is only triggered by melee damage.</li>\n<li>It does not affect Bosses.</li>\n<li>It is shown as dark purple text. So 32 damage would show up as <span class=\"tibiatext tibiadarkpurple\">32</span>.</li></ul>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-List_of_Items_that_have_Damage_Reflection\">List of Items that have Damage Reflection</span></h3>\n<table class=\"wikitable sortable\" style=\"text-align:center;\">\n<caption style=\"text-align:center;\">\n</caption>\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Name</th>\n<th></th>\n<th>Vocation</th>\n<th>Min. Level</th>\n<th>Attributes\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Eldritch Shield</td>\n<td><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Eldritch Shield\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Eldritch_Shield_7edef1.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></td>\n<td>knights\n</td>\n<td>270\n</td>\n<td>42 Damage Reflection\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"#/wiki/Spiritthorn%20Helmet\">Spiritthorn Helmet</a></td>\n<td><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Spiritthorn Helmet\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Spiritthorn_Helmet_f79a73.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></td>\n<td>knights\n</td>\n<td>400\n</td>\n<td>sword fighting +3, axe fighting +3, club fighting +3, 13 damage reflection\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"#/wiki/Spiritthorn%20Armor\">Spiritthorn Armor</a></td>\n<td><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Spiritthorn Armor\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Spiritthorn_Armor_caae35.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></td>\n<td>knights\n</td>\n<td>400\n</td>\n<td>sword fighting +4, axe fighting +4, club fighting +4, 19 damage reflection\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Eldritch Crescent Moon Spade</td>\n<td><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Eldritch Crescent Moon Spade\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Eldritch_Crescent_Moon_Spade_5d02dc.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></td>\n<td>monks\n</td>\n<td>250\n</td>\n<td>fist fighting +2, magic level +2, 50 damage reflection\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Gilded Eldritch Crescent Moon Spade</td>\n<td><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Gilded Eldritch Crescent Moon Spade\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Gilded_Eldritch_Crescent_Moon_Spade_146f28.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></td>\n<td>monks\n</td>\n<td>250\n</td>\n<td>fist fighting +2, magic level +2, 50 damage reflection\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Damage_Reflection_by_Creatures\">Damage Reflection by Creatures</span></h2>\n<p>Creatures with this ability will reflect a certain percentage of the damage they receive to the aggressor. This percentage can be much greater than 100%, meaning a lot more damage than was initially dealt. The Creature's resistances is not affected by this, some creatures reflect the damage of elements they are immune against, while others reflect damage of elements they are neutral to.\n</p><p>When you deal damage to a creature with damage reflection (for example neutral with 10% reflection), the following messages are displayed on the Server Log Channel:\n</p>\n<dl><dd><span class=\"tibiatext tibiawhite\">You lose 115 hitpoints due to an attack by <i>Creature</i>. (damage reflection)</span></dd>\n<dd><span class=\"tibiatext tibiawhite\"><i>Creature</i> loses 1150 hitpoints due to your attack.</span></dd></dl>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-List_of_Creatures_that_use_Damage_Reflection\">List of Creatures that use Damage Reflection</span></h3>\n<table class=\"wikitable sortable\" style=\"text-align:center;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Name</th>\n<th>Photo</th>\n<th>Reflection %</th>\n<th>Damage Type\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"#/wiki/Vampire%20Bat\">Vampire Bat</a></td>\n<td><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Vampire%20Bat\"><img alt=\"Vampire Bat\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Vampire_Bat_8bc534.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></span></td>\n<td>100%</td>\n<td>Damage Modifiers\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"#/wiki/Burster%20Spectre\">Burster Spectre</a></td>\n<td><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Burster%20Spectre\"><img alt=\"Burster Spectre\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Burster_Spectre_0439b3.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></span></td>\n<td>133%</td>\n<td><a href=\"#/wiki/Ice%20Damage\">Ice Damage</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"#/wiki/Gazer%20Spectre\">Gazer Spectre</a></td>\n<td><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Gazer%20Spectre\"><img alt=\"Gazer Spectre\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Gazer_Spectre_50ea1d.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></span></td>\n<td>133%</td>\n<td><a href=\"#/wiki/Fire%20Damage\">Fire Damage</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"#/wiki/Ripper%20Spectre\">Ripper Spectre</a></td>\n<td><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Ripper%20Spectre\"><img alt=\"Ripper Spectre\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Ripper_Spectre_322f64.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></span></td>\n<td>133%</td>\n<td>Earth Damage\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"#/wiki/Crazed%20Summer%20Rearguard\">Crazed Summer Rearguard</a></td>\n<td><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Crazed%20Summer%20Rearguard\"><img alt=\"Crazed Summer Rearguard\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Crazed_Summer_Rearguard_236790.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></span></td>\n<td>100%</td>\n<td><a href=\"#/wiki/Fire%20Damage\">Fire Damage</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"#/wiki/Crazed%20Summer%20Vanguard\">Crazed Summer Vanguard</a></td>\n<td><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Crazed%20Summer%20Vanguard\"><img alt=\"Crazed Summer Vanguard\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Crazed_Summer_Vanguard_3ed940.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></span></td>\n<td>100%</td>\n<td><a href=\"#/wiki/Fire%20Damage\">Fire Damage</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"#/wiki/Insane%20Siren\">Insane Siren</a></td>\n<td><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Insane%20Siren\"><img alt=\"Insane Siren\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Insane_Siren_5e93a1.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></span></td>\n<td>100%</td>\n<td><a href=\"#/wiki/Fire%20Damage\">Fire Damage</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"#/wiki/Crazed%20Winter%20Rearguard\">Crazed Winter Rearguard</a></td>\n<td><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Crazed%20Winter%20Rearguard\"><img alt=\"Crazed Winter Rearguard\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Crazed_Winter_Rearguard_458ba1.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></span></td>\n<td>100%</td>\n<td><a href=\"#/wiki/Ice%20Damage\">Ice Damage</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"#/wiki/Crazed%20Winter%20Vanguard\">Crazed Winter Vanguard</a></td>\n<td><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Crazed%20Winter%20Rearguard\"><img alt=\"Crazed Winter Rearguard\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Crazed_Winter_Rearguard_458ba1.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></span></td>\n<td>100%</td>\n<td><a href=\"#/wiki/Ice%20Damage\">Ice Damage</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"#/wiki/Soul-Broken%20Harbinger\">Soul-Broken Harbinger</a></td>\n<td><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Soul-Broken%20Harbinger\"><img alt=\"Soul-Broken Harbinger\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Soul_Broken_Harbinger_77e7db.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></span></td>\n<td>100%</td>\n<td><a href=\"#/wiki/Ice%20Damage\">Ice Damage</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"#/wiki/Spiky%20Carnivor\">Spiky Carnivor</a></td>\n<td><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Spiky%20Carnivor\"><img alt=\"Spiky Carnivor\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Spiky_Carnivor_f38483.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></span></td>\n<td>50%?</td>\n<td><a href=\"#/wiki/Physical%20Damage\">Physical Damage</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"#/wiki/Menacing%20Carnivor\">Menacing Carnivor</a></td>\n<td><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Menacing%20Carnivor\"><img alt=\"Menacing Carnivor\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Menacing_Carnivor_49a33e.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></span></td>\n<td>100%?</td>\n<td><a href=\"#/wiki/Physical%20Damage\">Physical Damage</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"#/wiki/Ogre%20Ruffian\">Ogre Ruffian</a></td>\n<td><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Ogre%20Ruffian\"><img alt=\"Ogre Ruffian\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Ogre_Ruffian_6c456a.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></span></td>\n<td>35%</td>\n<td><a href=\"#/wiki/Physical%20Damage\">Physical Damage</a>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Damage_Reflection_by_Bosses\">Damage Reflection by Bosses</span></h2>\n<p>Bosses with this ability will reflect a certain percentage of the damage they receive to the aggressor. This percentage can be much greater than 100%, meaning a lot more damage than was initially dealt. The resistances can affect this.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-List_of_Bosses_that_use_Damage_Reflection\">List of Bosses that use Damage Reflection</span></h3>\n<table class=\"wikitable sortable\" style=\"text-align:center;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Name</th>\n<th></th>\n<th>Reflection %</th>\n<th>Damage Type\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"#/wiki/The%20Armored%20Voidborn\">The Armored Voidborn</a></td>\n<td><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/The%20Armored%20Voidborn\"><img alt=\"The Armored Voidborn\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/The_Armored_Voidborn_4bb565.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></span></td>\n<td>100%</td>\n<td>All\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"#/wiki/The%20Source%20of%20Corruption\">The Source of Corruption</a></td>\n<td><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/The%20Source%20of%20Corruption\"><img alt=\"The Source of Corruption\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Sphere_of_Wrath_ae568e.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></span></td>\n<td>15%</td>\n<td>All\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"#/wiki/Zarcorix%20of%20Yalahar\">Zarcorix of Yalahar</a></td>\n<td><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Zarcorix%20of%20Yalahar\"><img alt=\"Zarcorix of Yalahar\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Azerus_4933bc.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></span></td>\n<td>300%</td>\n<td>All\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"#/wiki/Sand%20Vortex\">Sand Vortex</a></td>\n<td><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Sand%20Vortex\"><img alt=\"Sand Vortex\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Sand_Vortex_a5bdd5.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span></td>\n<td>100%?</td>\n<td>All\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"#/wiki/Force%20Field\">Force Field</a></td>\n<td><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Force%20Field\"><img alt=\"Force Field\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Force_Field_5ac01f.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></span></td>\n<td>10-20%</td>\n<td>All\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"#/wiki/Faceless%20Bane\">Faceless Bane</a></td>\n<td><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Faceless%20Bane\"><img alt=\"Faceless Bane\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Faceless_Bane_aec419.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></span></td>\n<td>85%</td>\n<td>Death Damage\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"#/wiki/The%20Scourge%20of%20Oblivion%20%28Reflective%29\">The Scourge of Oblivion (Reflective)</a></td>\n<td><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/The%20Scourge%20of%20Oblivion%20%28Reflective%29\"><img alt=\"The Scourge of Oblivion (Reflective)\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/The_Scourge_of_Oblivion_Reflective_6d52b9.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></span></td>\n<td>3000~%</td>\n<td>All\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"#/wiki/Bragrumol\">Bragrumol</a></td>\n<td><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Bragrumol\"><img alt=\"Bragrumol\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Bragrumol_7c89c9.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></span></td>\n<td>95%</td>\n<td>Death Damage\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"#/wiki/Xogixath\">Xogixath</a></td>\n<td><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Xogixath\"><img alt=\"Xogixath\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Xogixath_72789c.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></span></td>\n<td>55%</td>\n<td><a href=\"#/wiki/Fire%20Damage\">Fire Damage</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"#/wiki/Leiden\">Leiden</a></td>\n<td><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Leiden\"><img alt=\"Leiden\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Leiden_760755.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></span></td>\n<td>?%</td>\n<td>All?\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"#/wiki/Neferi%20the%20Spy\">Neferi the Spy</a></td>\n<td><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Neferi%20the%20Spy\"><img alt=\"Neferi The Spy\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Neferi_The_Spy_324d98.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></span></td>\n<td>11.4%</td>\n<td>Death Damage\n</td></tr></tbody></table></div>","quests":["the-secret-library-quest"]}